{"3777020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Service with a Shotgun", "steam_appid": 3777020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>As if retail wasn't hell enough...</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777020/extras/c7ec39b88ae4da9f52ef880025c788d8.avif?t=1764349542\" width=800 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777020/extras/b94881df85b3ebf3824519f4a03c857c.poster.avif?t=1764349542\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777020/extras/b94881df85b3ebf3824519f4a03c857c.webm?t=1764349542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777020/extras/b94881df85b3ebf3824519f4a03c857c.mp4?t=1764349542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the last poor soul manning a beat-up roadside shop in the middle of the zombie apocalypse. The world's gone to hell, but somehow your &quot;Open&quot; sign still flickers. Between lunatic customers, long shifts, and the occasional undead trying to snag a snack, you're keeping the business alive - barely. Because even in the apocalypse, someone’s gotta work retail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777020/extras/9735ad356d7995634f11a6f13c45062b.avif?t=1764349542\" width=800 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777020/extras/bffeae73421b4b9a42e389a5392a827d.poster.avif?t=1764349542\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777020/extras/bffeae73421b4b9a42e389a5392a827d.webm?t=1764349542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777020/extras/bffeae73421b4b9a42e389a5392a827d.mp4?t=1764349542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part visual novel, part chaotic flash-game shooter, <strong>SWAS</strong> is a wild ride through survival customer service, and the weird bonds we forge in unexpected circumstances. Blast your way through zombie hordes, slap together last-minute defences, and deal with a rotating cast of desperate, and sometimes deranged regulars.   <br><br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777020/extras/5aa0b5b582b7facc2439ff21d91bdb39.avif?t=1764349542\" width=800 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777020/extras/97e44a3eea9070df427d3ba29b3ab619.poster.avif?t=1764349542\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777020/extras/97e44a3eea9070df427d3ba29b3ab619.webm?t=1764349542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777020/extras/97e44a3eea9070df427d3ba29b3ab619.mp4?t=1764349542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every chapter in <strong>SWAS</strong> cranks up the chaos with wild twists, new characters, and new threats. What starts as a simple shift quickly spirals out of control. Shoot straight. Talk fast. Surely nothing can go wrong. Right?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual Novel X FPS</strong> - A unique blend of genres to combine story-telling with action!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Story-Rich Chapters</strong> - Each chapter in SWAS brings a new twist and challenge as the story unfolds.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cast of Colourful Characters</strong> - Meet and serve 10+ individuals each with their own quirks and stories.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777020/extras/31e823fa502052f107a9c674f3dbfeb6.poster.avif?t=1764349542\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777020/extras/31e823fa502052f107a9c674f3dbfeb6.webm?t=1764349542\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777020/extras/31e823fa502052f107a9c674f3dbfeb6.mp4?t=1764349542\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >If you love, these games, we think SWAS is just right for you.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VA-11 Hall-A: Cyberpunk Bartender Action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Cafe</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Urban Myth Dissolution Centre</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>As if retail wasn't hell enough...</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777020/extras/c7ec39b88ae4da9f52ef880025c788d8.avif?t=1764349542\" width=800 height=105 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\